ormal;widows: 2;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, system-ui, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;text-align: justify;\">\n                    帕帕尤的咖啡樱桃很有特色，形状细长，它的名字大概率来自于它形似木瓜果实。帕帕尤品种在慧兰省以外的地区非常罕见，人们对它如何出现在哥伦比亚知之甚少。它最初被认为是卡杜拉的突变，但世界咖啡研究中心的基因测序表明它与埃塞俄比亚的原生种有密切关系。\n                   </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;\">\n                      关于Tabi\n                      <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n                      </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n                      </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n                      </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n                      </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n                      </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n                      </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;font-size: 14px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;widows: 2;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, system-ui, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;text-align: justify;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;text-align: justify;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;text-align: justify;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;text-align: justify;\">\n                        Tabi是哥伦比亚咖啡研究机构CENICAFE内部研发并推广的一个改良品种，取名于当地土著部落的语言，意为“好”。从1961年开始到2002年正式推出历时40余年。Tabi是人工杂交Typica, Bourbon和Timor Hybrid后得到的优良品种，其中最显著的特征是对叶锈病的抵抗力极强。这也是Orlando像慧兰大部分农民一样选择种植Tabi的原因。Tabi品种还有一个优势是沿袭了铁皮卡和波旁的优质杯品表现，可以高密度种植且适应高海拔，这对大多数种植条件一般的农户来说是一个优势品种。\n                       </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;\">\n                      关于绿宝石庄园\n                      <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n                      </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n                      </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n                      </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n                      </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n   